{"title":"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A square and a triangle have equal perimeters. The lengths of the three sides of the triangle are 6.1 cm, 8.2 cm and 9.7 cm. What is the area of the square in square centimeters?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/d/9ed94c485ad2d6dbc2b761526a30c9df375c15ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 24\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 25\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 36\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 48\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The perimeter of the triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/a/eca7133b74f38dffab6324e2812bc5e6420d6fd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.1+8.2+9.7=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"156\" height=\"14\" /> cm. A square's perimeter is four times its sidelength, since all its sidelengths are equal. If the square's perimeter is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, the sidelength is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/0/780d4aad97bd8af143b4abe6f09f098ce71df9d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24/4=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" />, and the area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/1/771674cc564f44327f73e00cb32c17585bcd913f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^2=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"105\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8\" title=\"2005 AMC 8\">2005 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2005\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/